         damaged entry into a plain miss. Neither is provable by looking at a picture: a
         stale hit shows a perfectly good image, just the wrong one. All five are
         whole-file "#If Not NETFRAMEWORK", so they and their tests compile to nothing on
         the net48 leg, matching the shipped shape. They pull in nothing new - AppPaths and
